e-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/comfy-jam-summer-2026/rate/4496626\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Comfy Jam: Summer\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4496626/stella-nova\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_medium family_sans-serif\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Stella Nova\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3MDA1NDIwLnBuZw==/original/%2BaGmr2.png\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Stella Nova</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_9934020\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable terminal simulation for Windows and macOS</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://davesgames.itch.io/stella-nova/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4474070/Stella_Nova/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4474070/Stella_Nova/</a>&nbsp;&lt;&lt; WISHLIST NOW!<br><br><a href=\"http://www.davesgames.io\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">www.davesgames.io</a>&nbsp;<br><br>The solar system used to be sprawling with interstellar&nbsp;life, but the&nbsp;<strong>Great Cataclysm</strong>&nbsp;could never have&nbsp;been anticipated. All systems went dark. Entire civilizations were lost. Everything and everyone has fallen apart.&nbsp;\r\n</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Everyone but you.</strong></em>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>It is now your mission to rebuild the once vibrant solar system into a new civilization, and&nbsp;<em>reclaim what was lost.</em><br></p>\r\n<p>Built from scratch in Rust by a solo developer (that&#x27;s me, Dave!), Stella Nova unravels as a&nbsp;<em><strong>living universe</strong></em>&nbsp;where you are the&nbsp;<strong>builder</strong>,&nbsp;the&nbsp;<strong>fighter</strong>, the&nbsp;<strong>politician</strong>. You will&nbsp;take helm of the reconstruction of a spacefaring civilization. This is a unique space colony simulator experience set in an&nbsp;<em><strong>infinite procedurally-generated universe</strong></em>.&nbsp;\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Stella Nova features:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Accurate Time Dilating Astrophysics Engine</strong>\r\n<ul><li>Stella Nova features a living and breathing universe with thousands of dynamic objects visible and adhering to real n-body orbital physics. A unique aspect of the rendering engine built from scratch is that the player has control over the flow of time, dilating and compressing the flow of time at will.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n</li><li><strong>Complex Modular Station Construction</strong>\r\n<ul><li>Create stations which are little factories that you will develop to automatically manufacture resources, with the help of your citizens, that is :)\r\n</li></ul>\r\n</li><li><strong>Colony Management</strong>\r\n<ul><li>Assign citizens to attend to various tasks to support the wellbeing of your colony. You just give them an assignment, and they do the work!\r\n</li></ul>\r\n</li><li><strong>Emergent Storytelling</strong>&nbsp;\r\n<ul><li>Featuring an emergent storyteller that creates events in-game based on the status of your colony to drive the story forward!\r\n</li></ul>\r\n</li><li><strong>Interplanetary Travel</strong>\r\n<ul><li>Work with real orbital mechanics and physics in order to fly interplanetary distances on crafts powered by your citizens. Manufacture fuel and expand your civilization across the solar system</li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_9156081\" class=\"game_info_panel_widge